                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6da4f76-9189-4b4c-be12-9e562d0a21c6",
                                "sense_id": "e40db4f0-1abe-3451-a689-e4a761452ba7",
                                "text": "Дура́к Азо́рка, чёрный дворо́вый пёс, жела́я, вероя́тно, извини́ться пе́ред на́ми за свой напра́сный лай, несме́ло подошёл к нам и завиля́л хвосто́м.",
                                "translation": "\"The fool,\" Azorka, a black house-dog, probably conscious of his guilt in barking for nothing and anxious to propitiate us, approached us, diffidently wagging his tail.",
                                "english": "\"The fool,\" Azorka, a black house-dog, probably conscious of his guilt in barking for nothing and anxious to propitiate us, approached us, diffidently wagging his tail."
                            }
                        ]
